  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNWomen Women, Peace and Security in Nigeria 2021 - 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the WPS Programme in Nigeria is to create an enabling environment for the implementation of WPS Commitments through strengthening policy frameworks (National Action Plan and State Action Plans), capacity, coordination, and oversight of Federal and State entities, and increasing the meaningful participation of women to deliver on UNSCR 1325 commitments for conflict prevention and sustainable peace in two states of Nigeria (Kaduna and Plateau). The programme also aims at strengthening the representation and participation of women in political leadership.</narrative>
  </description>
